# Derived panels and study artefacts. Rebuildable from the scripts in this directory:
#   build_jpm_repo_panel.py  ->  _data/jpm_*.parquet
#   build_bond_panel.py      ->  _data/alias_cusip_map.parquet, _data/bond_panel.parquet
#   run_study.py             ->  _out/*
# The bond panel alone is ~4000 business days x 28 alias slots and takes ~40 min to fetch,
# so it is cached locally rather than committed.
